---
description: >-
  Verifies precedence across three simultaneous styling mechanisms: the implicit
  `default` classDef (applies to c), an explicit `:::blue` classDef (applies to
  p), and a direct `style` statement (also applies to c, on top of default)
  under the elk layout.
config:
  layout: elk
---
erDiagram
      c[CUSTOMER]
      p[PERSON]:::blue
      classDef blue stroke:lightblue, color: #0000FF
      classDef default fill:pink
      style c color:green
